  "_comment": "Wave 73 Bucket C — UserPromptSubmit dynamic rule digest injection mapping. Keyword patterns are case-insensitive regex (Python re). Each match injects §1 The Rule + earliest Anti-patterns section (capped by max_lines). Total cap across all matches: 5000 tokens (~20000 chars).",
